      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "永四百七拾九貫貳百三拾文三分貳厘七毛"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "永（えい）四百七十九貫二百三十文三分二厘七毛"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Eisen (ei) figure: 479 kan 230 mon 3 bu 2 rin 7 mo (=479.23037 kan-mon). A large ei-denominated amount — Asahiyama lay in Echigo, where land was often assessed and levied in eisen (kan-mon) rather than koku. Self-labeled by the leading 永 glyph."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "永"
      }
    ],
