    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "右金永合金五百貳拾九兩三分永四拾貳文八分貳厘七毛"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "右金永合（みぎ きん・えい あわせ）金五百二十九両三分、永四十二文八分二厘七毛"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "'Gold and eisen combined, as above' subtotal: 529 ryo 3 bu in gold, plus 42 mon 8 bu 2 rin 7 mo in eisen. Sums the domain's cash-denominated tax items; the large 479-kan eisen figure above is an assessment and is not summed here. The 4-glyph heading 右金永合 stands at the top-right; the paired figures fill the column at left."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "右金永合"
      }
    ],
