        "value": "此米貳百八拾貳俵貳斗八合五勺六才餘"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "此米（このこめ）二百八十二俵二斗八合五勺六才余"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "The same cash subtotal expressed in rice (kono-kome): 282 bales plus a 0.20856-koku remainder (餘 = 'and a fraction more'). 貳斗八合… skips the 升 place (=0). Converts the 右金永合 cash total into its rice equivalent."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "此米"
