      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Combined rice of the two portions (futakuchi-awase): 43,408 bales plus a 0.28303-koku remainder (餘). = 此俵 43,126 bales + 此米 282 bales; remainder = 0.07447 + 0.20856. Both the proposed 43,488 and MASTER's 43,488 are wrong — a phantom 十 was inserted after 四百八."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
